  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>多重箭矢效果</strong> 新增了一种合成机制，允许您将最多三种药水效果合并到一支箭矢上，统一所有效果属性，创造出功能极其多样且具有战略意义的投射物。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">本模组允许您合并药水箭矢，将其效果属性融合到一次射击中。您可以在同一支箭矢上叠加最多三种不同的药水效果，制造出同时施加多种效果的强力投射物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1396590/description_b5ceb87e-ed2f-456a-9c49-4403ed3be7dc.png\" width=\"368\" height=\"285\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">所有设置均可完全自定义：您可以通过配置文件调整最大合并效果数量、微调持续时间、禁用特定药水或更改合成行为，使系统适应任何世界或整合包。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">本模组与其他箭矢及药水模组完全兼容，可使用游戏中任何药水的效果。通过将滞留药水与箭矢围合成药水箭矢，即可应用任意效果，随后将其合并为一支增强型投射物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eb7f55c5-3947-420b-89ff-328b3a283b3e.png\"></span></p>\n</div><div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"353\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即获取您的专属Minecraft服务器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">，与朋友们一起享受无尽的冒险！凭借出色的性能和可靠的运行时间，我们的服务器确保每位玩家都能获得流畅有趣的游戏体验。使用代码 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享受 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">75折优惠！</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Discord.webp\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></span></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
